\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Do you surely know who loves you,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Who has an exceeding love;
\par And always keeps watch over you;
\par In whatever path you tread?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Do you know who gives you your life
\par And who gives you good parents,
\par He who provides you more good deeds,
\par And always keeps you in mind?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2. Do you know He who died for you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 On the hill of Golgotha,
\par Who accomplished your salvation
\par Through the death that He suffered?
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yes, I know him and remember
\par Jesus who is my shepherd,
\par Surely, He is mine completely,
\par And He calls me as His lamb.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He loves me, so I love Him too,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He is the one I do praise.
\par Hallelujah!  I am happy,
\par With His love which is so pure.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hallelujah ! I am happy,
\par I shall go to Jesus Christ
\par Heav'nly angels shall welcome me
\par To ever see my Jesus.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

